From 3b831a31fbca6e14cf20709fa752785fb4bf0b00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:03:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] outcome: a done chat names the cards it still
 watches (eye glyph + tooltip, done_watching audit)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Self-heal desktop-e6cce5965c: a card parked watch=true leaves the chat's open
work, so the row went plain green with a check still pending. A done outcome
now carries the chat's watch-parked cards as `watches` (like owned crons);
the stripe draws an eye glyph and the tooltip says 'Still watching: t_… (wakes
Wed 09:00)'; outcome-audit reports done_watching; kanban_schedule's watch
description/result tell the agent to name the pending check.
